# test Program version

# this feature is disabled by default
ውጤት ፃፍ: (
	ፕሮግራም ባህሪ: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), አዲስ-መስመር.


# but if we set the time back
>> today := አፍታ 
ዞን: ['CEST'],
ምንጭ: ['2026-02-15 10:00:00'].
ፕሮግራም ስሪት: today.

# it will be enabled like it used to be (from now on)
ውጤት ፃፍ: (
	ፕሮግራም ባህሪ: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), አዲስ-መስመር.